1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
老板们，小企业用 AI
Bosses, for small businesses using AI

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
第一步到底该做什么？
What should you do first?

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
不是买系统，不是招技术
Not buying systems, not hiring tech

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,100
而是找一个重复动作
Find one repeated task

5
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:17,000
为什么？
Why?

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
很多人用 AI，还停留在聊天窗口里
Many people still use AI only in chat

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,000
写文案、写通知、解释表格
Copywriting, notices, spreadsheet explainers

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
它确实挺行
It is genuinely useful

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,120
但关掉窗口以后，公司还是原样跑
But after closing it, the business is unchanged

10
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:41,460
过去的 AI 更像聊天机器人
Old AI felt more like a chatbot

11
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:46,320
现在它能替你完成一段工作
Now it can complete a workflow for you

12
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:50,400
比如营销上
For example, in marketing

13
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:54,700
写本地广告、网站文案
Local ads and website copy

14
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:58,500
短视频脚本、客户评论回复
Short-video scripts and review replies

15
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:04,460
客服上，整理消息并提醒跟进
In service, sort messages and remind follow-ups

16
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:09,200
小企业用 AI 最重要的纪律
The key rule for small businesses using AI

17
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:13,000
AI 做事，人守门
AI does the work, people guard the gate

18
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,500
发客户、付款、发布、提交
Clients, payments, publishing, submissions

19
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:23,000
都不能直接让 AI 放出去
Do not let AI send them out directly

20
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,540
必须有人确认一遍
A person must review it first

21
00:01:26,540 --> 00:01:30,500
具体怎么开始？
So how do you start?

22
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:35,500
列一个“反待办清单”
Make an anti-to-do list

23
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:41,260
写下哪些事，你不想再亲手做
Write what you no longer want to do by hand

24
00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:45,500
注意，只挑一个
Remember: pick only one

25
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:50,500
把产品、报价、常见问题整理给 AI
Give AI your products, prices, and FAQs

26
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:54,600
让它先在内部跑一周
Let it run internally for one week

27
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:59,500
这一周只看三个指标
Track only three metrics this week

28
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:04,200
第一，有没有真的省时间
First, did it really save time?

29
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:08,700
第二，有没有减少漏回复、漏跟进
Second, did it reduce missed replies?

30
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:15,780
第三，改一改是不是就能用
Third, can it work after small tweaks?

31
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:20,000
如果不行，先别急着换工具
If not, don't rush to switch tools

32
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:26,000
看看资料是不是太少、太旧、太乱
Check if your data is too little, old, or messy

33
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,500
AI 做不好，很多时候不是模型问题
When AI fails, it is often not the model

34
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:36,100
是公司信息还没准备好
It is the business info not being ready

35
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:41,000
小企业用 AI，不要先追风口
For small businesses, do not chase hype first

36
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:46,000
先省下一个人的半小时
Save one person's half hour first

37
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:51,000
半小时省出来，业务跑顺了
Once that half hour is saved and work runs smoother

38
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,360
再谈系统化、自动化、智能化
Then talk systems, automation, and intelligence
